THIS ARM IS A GPU LEG (contract 13.5, assumption A5), in BOTH directions: it is contaminated by any other lane's GPU work on this box AND it contaminates theirs. tools/gemm_price.sh looks for a concurrent mojo/pixi process at both ends and reports what it found; it does not refuse, so read that line.
EVERY DEVICE NUMBER BELOW IS INDICATIVE. The M4's governor pins at MINIMUM clock under heat -- 96% of an 11-second trace while 93.8% busy -- and drifts up to 1.7x across twenty minutes. Timing is the identity lane's to certify and nothing here is a certification.

