READ THE MODE RATIOS AS A BAND. The two modes are two BINARIES and
cannot be interleaved inside one process; 1 rounds is 1 samples per
cell and the M4 drifts up to 1.7x across twenty minutes. The
within-mode table does not carry that caveat -- those arms alternate
call by call -- but it carries contract 13.7's instead: it is a HOST
ratio between two HOST functions, the device kernel is Phase 2b, and
nothing here says the balanced fold is faster or slower on a GPU.
